                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No.
                    176.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>THE MEXICANS IN TEXAS.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Diario Oficial, City of
                            <placeName>Mexico</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-08-29">August 29, 1874</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>A Matamoras paper calls the attention of the minister of foreign relations to the
                    occurrences which have taken place in Texas, in the United States, in which
                    several Mexican citizens have been the victims. Mr. Lafragua, on learning the
                    facts, at once sent instructions to the Mexican minister at Washington to take
                    proper steps in the matter.</p>
            </div>
